## CSS Custom Properties

## Syntax

```css
/* Declaration — must start with -- */
:root {
  --color-primary: #0070f3;
  --spacing-4: 1rem;
  --radius: 4px;
}

/* Usage */
.button {
  background: var(--color-primary);
  padding: var(--spacing-4);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
}

/* Fallback value */
.card { color: var(--text, #333); }
```

## vs Preprocessor Variables

| | CSS Custom Properties | Sass/SCSS Variables |
|---|---|---|
| Runtime? | Yes — live in the DOM | No — compiled away |
| JavaScript access | Yes | No |
| Cascade/inherit | Yes | No |
| Media query override | Yes | No |
| Browser support | All modern browsers | Requires build step |

## Dark Mode Theming

```css
:root {
  --bg: #fff;
  --text: #111;
}

@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  :root {
    --bg: #111;
    --text: #f5f5f5;
  }
}

body { background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); }
```

## JavaScript Integration

```js
// Read
getComputedStyle(document.documentElement)
  .getPropertyValue('--color-primary'); // '#0070f3'

// Write
document.documentElement.style
  .setProperty('--color-primary', '#ff0000');
```

## Component-Level Scoping

```css
.card {
  --card-padding: 1rem;
  padding: var(--card-padding);
}

.card--compact {
  --card-padding: 0.5rem; /* overrides for this variant only */
}
```
